dt=Text
<node>
onfirst
3
clear
msg:\c##SUBTITLE##
	\c
	\cOriginal \yBASIC\w Game by
	\c\y##ORIGINALAUTHOR##\w
	\c
	\c\yStoryTllrC64\w release 
	\cby \y##AUTHOR##\w
waitkey
goto:_introduction

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
_introduction
2
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
image:png\_title.jpg
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
name:Introduction
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
onfirst
3
clear
msg:The Sylvani once lived peacefully at the foot of Silver Mountain, guided by wise Elders and protected by the mystical Stone of Destiny. 
msg: But when the vicious Grarg army invaded, their queen, Pari Sylvan, used the Stone to resist them. 
msg: In the battle of minds that followed, a traitor fell, and the Grarg wizard Magrarg seized control. The Sylvani became slaves under the brutal Overlord Ogban. 
msg: Queen Pari's son, Kylar, raised in secret, sought magical relics to defeat the evil, but was killed before completing his quest. 
msg: Now the Elders call to any brave soul: will you finish what Kylar began?
setvar:maxweight,13
setvar:coinnum,4
setvar:bootsusage,0
setvar:boatwater,0
waitkey
goto:crossroads

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
_dead
2
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
image:png\_title.jpg
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
name:You're dead!
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
onfirst
3
clear
msg:You have failed in your quest!
msg:Your sudden death is yet another failure in your attempt to free the Sylvani people from tyranny.
msg:Do you want to try again? (Y/N)
getkey
ifkey:Y
	start
else
	quit

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
_end
2
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
image:png\_title.jpg
3
<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
dt=Text
<node>
onfirst
3
clear
msg:While you walk towards the Piazza Principe train station you think that there are strange things moving around this story and you are now more than ever determined to find the missing box. 
msg:On another hand, you're happy to come home, to see your family. 
msg:You catch your train and, rocked by the wagon movements, you rapidly fall asleep; your last thought was a pleasant one: you are going to see Democrito, your cat, real soon!
waitkey
clear
msg:The first part of this game ends here.
msg:If you want to know how the story goes on, you can load the second part of the game using one of the available original versions.
msg:In that case, use #SHIBBOLETH #FANFALUCH to access it.
waitkey
quit

<end node> 5P9i0s8y19Z
